## **What is Frontend?**

**Frontend** = Everything the user sees and interacts with
- The buttons
- The text input boxes
- The forms
- The colors
- The layout
- The icons

**Like:** The appearance of a restaurant (nice decorations, layout) vs. the kitchen (backend)

---

## **The Three Technologies Used**

### **1. HTML (The Structure)**
**What it does:** Creates the basic structure and elements

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>AI Skill Assessment Agent</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Hello!</h1>
    <button>Click Me</button>
</body>
