## **The Complete Flow (Visual)**

```
User visits http://localhost:5000/
    ↓
Flask loads index.html
    ↓
Browser displays upload form
    ↓
User uploads files or pastes text
    ↓
User clicks "Generate Assessment"
    ↓
Form data sent to /assess (backend)
    ↓
Backend processes (Python code)
    ↓
Backend calls render_template('results.html', result=data)
    ↓
Flask inserts data into results.html
    ↓
Jinja2 loops through data and generates HTML
    ↓
Browser displays beautiful results page
```

