## **Key Templating Features (Jinja2)**

Jinja2 is a template language that lets you put Python-like code in HTML:

```html
<!-- Loops -->
{% for item in list %}
    <p>{{ item }}</p>
{% endfor %}

<!-- Conditionals -->
{% if condition %}
    <p>Show this if true</p>
{% else %}
    <p>Show this if false</p>
{% endif %}

<!-- Filters -->
{{ text|uppercase }}     <!-- Convert to uppercase -->
{{ number|round(2) }}    <!-- Round to 2 decimals -->
{{ list|length }}        <!-- Get list length -->

<!-- Variables -->
{{ variable_name }}      <!-- Insert variable value -->
```

