## **Simple Frontend Example**

Here's a minimal version to show how it works:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        .header {
            background: #667eea;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Skill Assessment</h1>
    </div>

    <!-- FORM -->
    <div class="container mt-4">
        <form action="/assess" method="post">
            <textarea name="resume" placeholder="Paste resume..."></textarea>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Assess</button>
        </form>
    </div>

    <!-- RESULTS (if available) -->
    {% if result %}
        <div class="container mt-4">
            <h2>Results:</h2>
            {% for skill in result.skills %}
                <span class="badge bg-success">{{ skill }}</span>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    {% endif %}
</body>
</html>
```

